msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Tome@Name"
msgstr "Tome of Scarlet Rot"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Tome@Desc"
msgstr ""
"This magic is not cast—it festers. The Curse of Rot is a slow-burning "
"affliction that corrupts organic matter, spiritual essence, and even "
"elemental constructs with creeping entropy. It is not a burst of power, but "
"a whisper of decay that lingers and multiplies."

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Tome@Lore"
msgstr ""
"\"I dreamt for so long. My flesh was dull gold...and my blood, rotted. "
"Corpse after corpse, left in my wake... Heed my words. The scarlet bloom "
"flowers once more. You will witness true horror. Now, rot! Let your flesh be "
"consumed. By the scarlet rot.\""

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Tome@Author"
msgstr "Blade of the Scarlet"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Enchantment@Name"
msgstr "Touch of Rot"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Enchantment@Desc"
msgstr ""
"When attacked in melee, inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SCARLET_ROT_VEC."
"Hyperlink} with 60% chance.\n"
"\n"
"Guaranteed for enchanted non-racial units "

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Transformation@Name"
msgstr "Blessing of the Scarlet Rot"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Transformation@Desc"
msgstr ""
"Rot for the scarlet goddess. The death that begets life. O scarlet blossoms, "
"flourish in distant lands, and return to us, the unwanted children. Your "
"race has:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FLYING_MOVEMENT.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PLANT.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"AURA_OF_DISEASE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASE_IMMUNITY."
"Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@TacticalSpell@Name"
msgstr "Aeiona Explosion"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@TacticalSpell@Desc"
msgstr ""
"Target friendly unit restores 30 <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept."
"Hyperlink}>> and 5x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION.Hyperlink}. Enemies "
"within 2-hexes sustain 15 {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]2x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SCARLET_ROT_VEC.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@RotStep@Name"
msgstr "Rot Step"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@RotStep@Desc"
msgstr ""
"Teleport to target hex, then adjacent enemies sustain damage:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]2x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SCARLET_ROT_VEC.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@ScarletWhirlwind@Name"
msgstr "Scarlet Whirlwind"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@StatusEffect@Name"
msgstr "Scarlet Rot"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@StatusEffect@Desc"
msgstr ""
"At 5 stacks, remove all stacks and inflict 20 {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MOTH_INDUCE_VEC.Hyperlink}."

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Unit@Name"
msgstr "Scarlet Knight"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Unit@Desc"
msgstr ""
"They were knights of golden resolve, sworn to a cause long buried beneath "
"rot and silence. When the blight spread across the battlefield, they did not "
"retreat—they embraced it. Their armor gleamed even as their flesh decayed, "
"sanctified not by victory, but by sacrifice."

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Unit2@Name"
msgstr "Scarlet Moth"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Unit2@Desc"
msgstr ""
"A moth affected by the Rot, rooted to it's very core - forever changing it. "
"These moths are tiny, but like wolves, come in large packs."

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Ascension_Skill@Name"
msgstr "Aeiona Explosion"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Ascension_Skill@Desc"
msgstr ""
"This unit restores 30 <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> and "
"3x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION.Hyperlink}. Enemies within 2-hexes "
"sustain 15 {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}:[bulletlist][bullet/]2x "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SCARLET_ROT_VEC.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@Unit3@Name"
msgstr "Baby Scarlet Moth"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@StatusEffect_Revival@Name"
msgstr "Moth-Induced"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@StatusEffect_Revival@Desc"
msgstr ""
"If this unit dies, they transform into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.VEC_BABY_MOTH."
"Hyperlink} under the opponent's control"

msgid "Tome_Scarlet@TacticalSpell@Desc2"
msgstr ""
"This unit restores 30 <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> and "
"3x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION.Hyperlink}. Enemies within 2-hexes "
"sustain 10 {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}:[bulletlist][bullet/]2x "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SCARLET_ROT_VEC.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

